Learn what you love and focus on it.

00:00:12.029 --> 00:00:14.096
Don't work for somebody else's dream.

00:00:14.096 --> 00:00:15.754
We're all human, we all make mistakes,

00:00:15.754 --> 00:00:17.210
we all learn.

00:00:17.210 --> 00:00:20.164
- He's an American penny
