00:00:44.656 --> 00:00:46.054
can be inspired as well.

00:00:46.054 --> 00:00:48.370
Also as you are writing something down

00:00:48.370 --> 00:00:51.476
it's much more likely to
stick in your head too.

00:00:51.476 --> 00:00:52.309
Enjoy.

