00:01:05.392 --> 00:01:07.985
- Hey, Tim Sykes, millionaire
mentor and trader here,

00:01:07.985 --> 00:01:10.192
with my ten keys to success.

00:01:10.192 --> 00:01:13.228
Check this place out,
we're here in Cambodia.

00:01:13.228 --> 00:01:14.784
