00:01:14.784 --> 00:01:16.696
to do a little educational video,

00:01:16.696 --> 00:01:18.870
but Evan Carmichael had me on his channel,

00:01:18.870 --> 00:01:22.664
so I'm going to give his
viewers my 10 keys for success.

00:01:22.664 --> 00:01:24.982
Number one, study the past.

00:01:24.982 --> 00:01:27.462
We're here in Cambodia, we're
looking at it, it's beautiful,

00:01:27.462 --> 00:01:29.447
but we're also learning from the past.

00:01:29.447 --> 00:01:31.672
For me, I study the stock market,

00:01:31.672 --> 00:01:34.131
my top students study the stock market.

00:01:34.131 --> 00:01:36.163
The key to success in the stock market

00:01:36.163 --> 00:01:39.523
is not just finding hot
picks or breaking news,

00:01:39.523 --> 00:01:42.035
it's studying the past,
seeing what worked before,

00:01:42.035 --> 00:01:44.238
because then you can be better
prepared for the present

00:01:44.238 --> 00:01:46.750
and you can get wealthier in the future.

00:01:46.750 --> 00:01:48.892
Rule number two, key for success.

00:01:48.892 --> 00:01:50.401
Keep an open mind.

00:01:50.401 --> 00:01:52.324
I know many of you guys would never come

00:01:52.324 --> 00:01:54.047
to a place like Cambodia.

00:01:54.047 --> 00:01:55.760
It's hot, I'm sweating, right,

00:01:55.760 --> 00:01:58.310
I'm eating weird food, my stomach
wasn't feeling that great,

00:01:58.310 --> 00:01:59.673
but I keep an open mind,

00:01:59.673 --> 00:02:01.260
because life is all about exploring.

00:02:01.260 --> 00:02:02.829
It's not just about financial gain,

00:02:02.829 --> 00:02:04.603
it's about growing your brain

00:02:04.603 --> 00:02:06.588
and your knowledge and experience.

00:02:06.588 --> 00:02:08.122
That's what I love.

00:02:08.122 --> 00:02:10.412
Key to success number three.

00:02:10.412 --> 00:02:12.932
Let's see, I would say planning,

00:02:12.932 --> 00:02:14.532
but I'm not very good at planning.

00:02:14.532 --> 00:02:16.372
I would say just going with the flow,

00:02:16.372 --> 00:02:18.517
and just being open to different things.

00:02:18.517 --> 00:02:20.207
I didn't plan on making this video,

00:02:20.207 --> 00:02:22.480
but Evan was nice enough to
make a little video about me

00:02:22.480 --> 00:02:24.439
and I wanted to do something in return,

00:02:24.439 --> 00:02:25.692
so I'm going with it.

00:02:25.692 --> 00:02:26.745
I'm here in Cambodia,

00:02:26.745 --> 00:02:29.369
tomorrow I'm actually
going to the Philippines,

00:02:29.369 --> 00:02:30.546
but freaking love it.

00:02:30.546 --> 00:02:31.961
I'll make a video from anywhere.

00:02:31.961 --> 00:02:33.561
Key to success number four.

00:02:33.561 --> 00:02:35.103
You can learn and you can make money

00:02:35.103 --> 00:02:36.808
from anywhere in the world.

00:02:36.808 --> 00:02:38.897
We're at a very unique
time in history right now.

00:02:38.897 --> 00:02:40.122
You have the internet.

00:02:40.122 --> 00:02:42.349
You're watching me, I'm not
necessarily watching you,

00:02:42.349 --> 00:02:44.726
but I can communicate with
you, I can leave comments,

00:02:44.726 --> 00:02:46.618
we can go back and forth, we can interact,

00:02:46.618 --> 00:02:49.465
that wasn't possible
just a few decades ago.

00:02:49.465 --> 00:02:51.667
This new technology has
opened up a whole new world

00:02:51.667 --> 00:02:55.058
of education and interaction,
take advantage of it.

00:02:55.058 --> 00:02:56.448
Don't get left out.

00:02:56.448 --> 00:02:59.218
Don't just watch a few YouTube
videos, use everything.

00:02:59.218 --> 00:03:01.628
Use Twitter, use Facebook, use Snapchat,

00:03:01.628 --> 00:03:03.738
use Pinterest, use Instagram,

00:03:03.738 --> 00:03:07.256
all the social media helps
us get more connected.

00:03:07.256 --> 00:03:10.625
Number five, use social media,
get your name out there.

00:03:10.625 --> 00:03:12.138
Get your wisdom out there.

00:03:12.138 --> 00:03:13.740
If you're an expert in anything,

00:03:13.740 --> 00:03:15.027
you can make a lot of money,

00:03:15.027 --> 00:03:16.209
you can find a lot of success,

00:03:16.209 --> 00:03:18.572
you don't just have to be a
doctor or a lawyer any more,

00:03:18.572 --> 00:03:20.007
there's so much money in the world,

00:03:20.007 --> 00:03:22.876
there's so much interest
and there's so many people

00:03:22.876 --> 00:03:24.521
and so many interesting subjects.

00:03:24.521 --> 00:03:26.411
All you have to do is be open minded,

00:03:26.411 --> 00:03:27.792
that's kind of what I am.

00:03:27.792 --> 00:03:29.485
Rule number six for success.

00:03:29.485 --> 00:03:32.334
Don't just take the traditional route.

00:03:32.334 --> 00:03:33.702
I know a lot of older people,

00:03:33.702 --> 00:03:35.181
your parents, your grandparents,

00:03:35.181 --> 00:03:36.947
think that success has to be down

00:03:36.947 --> 00:03:39.112
like a very certain narrow hallway,

00:03:39.112 --> 00:03:41.808
when in fact success is everything.

00:03:41.808 --> 00:03:44.112
The world is fantastic.

00:03:44.112 --> 00:03:46.795
I've been fortunate to visit
over a hundred plus countries,

00:03:46.795 --> 00:03:48.488
I've met so many different people

00:03:48.488 --> 00:03:50.174
and experienced different cultures,

00:03:50.174 --> 00:03:51.607
we're a lot more similar

00:03:51.607 --> 00:03:53.993
than a lot of people think that we are,

00:03:53.993 --> 00:03:55.093
we're all humans,

00:03:55.093 --> 00:03:58.281
we're all in this great
experience and journey together.

00:03:58.281 --> 00:04:00.698
Number seven, I would say ...

00:04:03.907 --> 00:04:06.291
I'm trying to keep this very general

00:04:06.291 --> 00:04:08.541
and very open to everybody.

00:04:10.076 --> 00:04:12.294
I would say focus on what you love.

00:04:12.294 --> 00:04:15.026
You know, I love to travel, I love to eat,

00:04:15.026 --> 00:04:16.900
I love to trade stocks, I love to teach,

00:04:16.900 --> 00:04:18.735
I love to get my message out there now

00:04:18.735 --> 00:04:20.252
through social media.

00:04:20.252 --> 00:04:22.539
And just learn what you
love and focus on it.

00:04:22.539 --> 00:04:24.520
Don't work for somebody else's dream,

00:04:24.520 --> 00:04:26.574
because no matter how
much money you're making

00:04:26.574 --> 00:04:28.062
or how successful you are,

00:04:28.062 --> 00:04:29.867
you're not focusing on yourself,

00:04:29.867 --> 00:04:31.629
and you have to be a little
selfish in this life,

00:04:31.629 --> 00:04:34.742
you have to do what you love
and figure out what you love.

00:04:34.742 --> 00:04:38.114
Number eight, study, study, study,

00:04:38.114 --> 00:04:40.336
so that you really
understand yourself better.

00:04:40.336 --> 00:04:43.737
Study a whole multitude
of different subjects

00:04:43.737 --> 00:04:46.329
and see, wait a minute,
what are you interested in?

00:04:46.329 --> 00:04:48.272
What's going to really
pique your interest?

00:04:48.272 --> 00:04:50.145
I was a philosophy major in college,

00:04:50.145 --> 00:04:51.834
all my friends were business and finance,

00:04:51.834 --> 00:04:53.713
but I took a philosophy
class and I was like,

00:04:53.713 --> 00:04:56.073
wow, I like thinking outside the box,

00:04:56.073 --> 00:04:58.680
I like how this, you know, makes me feel,

00:04:58.680 --> 00:05:00.185
I'm not a very good philosopher,

00:05:00.185 --> 00:05:02.213
I was actually the worst one in the class,

00:05:02.213 --> 00:05:05.288
because I didn't smoke weed and
I actually care about money,

00:05:05.288 --> 00:05:07.549
but at least I learned and now

00:05:07.549 --> 00:05:10.260
because of my philosophical teachings

00:05:10.260 --> 00:05:12.613
I kind of have a little bit
of a different education

00:05:12.613 --> 00:05:14.292
that I bring to the stock market

00:05:14.292 --> 00:05:15.667
and now the teaching world,

00:05:15.667 --> 00:05:17.970
and frankly, that's why
I have so much success.

00:05:17.970 --> 00:05:21.439
Number nine, focus on
your long term goals.

00:05:21.439 --> 00:05:24.230
I know we live in a world
full of instant gratification

00:05:24.230 --> 00:05:26.351
and you want money now, you want fame now,

00:05:26.351 --> 00:05:29.738
you want success now, but
if you want true success,

00:05:29.738 --> 00:05:33.126
it's going to take not just
days, weeks, or months,

00:05:33.126 --> 00:05:34.611
I'm not talking about going viral

00:05:34.611 --> 00:05:35.946
and being some viral sensation

00:05:35.946 --> 00:05:37.856
or being like some kid star

00:05:37.856 --> 00:05:39.811
or if you have like an
amazing voice or something,

00:05:39.811 --> 00:05:42.066
I'm talking about great, lasting success

00:05:42.066 --> 00:05:44.356
over the course of your
life, it's a journey,

00:05:44.356 --> 00:05:46.637
and it's going to take
years if not decades,

00:05:46.637 --> 00:05:48.903
and you're going to have ups
and you're going to have downs,

00:05:48.903 --> 00:05:51.532
and you have to respect
your entire journey.

00:05:51.532 --> 00:05:53.466
It's not just about where you end up,

00:05:53.466 --> 00:05:56.075
it's not just about the success
that you achieve at the end,

00:05:56.075 --> 00:05:57.784
it's the whole experience.

00:05:57.784 --> 00:06:00.288
That's life, that's the beauty of this.

00:06:00.288 --> 00:06:03.538
And number ten, do not be
afraid of making mistakes.

00:06:03.538 --> 00:06:05.248
Do not be afraid of failure,

00:06:05.248 --> 00:06:08.312
or if you're a stock
trader like me, loss, okay.

00:06:08.312 --> 00:06:11.170
Some of my biggest losses
have helped mold me

00:06:11.170 --> 00:06:13.504
and they helped develop
me into a better trader,

00:06:13.504 --> 00:06:14.999
into a better teacher.

00:06:14.999 --> 00:06:17.145
Obviously they suck, but again,

00:06:17.145 --> 00:06:20.208
we're all human, we all
make mistakes, we all learn.

00:06:20.208 --> 00:06:24.639
And lessons that we learn from
our losses and our mistakes

00:06:24.639 --> 00:06:26.634
and that we take into the future,

00:06:26.634 --> 00:06:28.875
that helps us make us better.

00:06:28.875 --> 00:06:31.065
So don't just ignore these lessons,

00:06:31.065 --> 00:06:33.310
don't just try to pretend
that you're perfect,

00:06:33.310 --> 00:06:35.411
don't sweep losses under the rug.

00:06:35.411 --> 00:06:37.049
Rule number one for me in the stock market

00:06:37.049 --> 00:06:38.257
is cut losses quickly,

00:06:38.257 --> 00:06:40.629
that's only because I've
taken several big losses

00:06:40.629 --> 00:06:43.399
in my career and I never
want that feeling again.

00:06:43.399 --> 00:06:45.836
So now it's made me a
more conservative trader,

00:06:45.836 --> 00:06:46.669
and teacher,

00:06:46.669 --> 00:06:49.294
and I was very angry with
those losses at first,

00:06:49.294 --> 00:06:51.093
now I'm very grateful for them.

00:06:51.093 --> 00:06:52.992
I appreciate the entire journey,

00:06:52.992 --> 00:06:55.553
and I want you to also.

00:06:55.553 --> 00:06:57.666
These are my ten keys to success.

00:06:57.666 --> 00:07:01.338
I'm going to go continue
exploring more of Cambodia

00:07:01.338 --> 00:07:04.106
and Angkor Wat and Angkor Thom and Bayon

00:07:04.106 --> 00:07:05.673
and all these amazing places.

00:07:05.673 --> 00:07:07.215
The world is a beautiful place,

00:07:07.215 --> 00:07:08.707
you're capable of anything,

00:07:08.707 --> 00:07:11.411
ignore the negativity, embrace positivity

00:07:11.411 --> 00:07:12.328
let's live!

